  description: "If you control a \"Six Samurai\" monster other than \"Anarchist Monk
    of the Six Samurai\", you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You
    can only Special Summon \"Anarchist Monk of the Six Samurai\" once per turn this
    way. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Anarchist Monk of the
    Six Samurai\" once per turn. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You
    can add 1 \"Six Samurai\" Quick-Play Spell from your Deck to your hand. A \"Six
    Samurai\" monster that was Synchro Summoned using this card gains this effect.\r\n\u25CF
    The Levels of all monsters your opponent controls are reduced by 1."
